# Design skill priority (Nagarik Watch)

When doing frontend / visual / UX work on this repo:

1. Read and follow `design-taste-frontend` (Leonxlnx taste-skill) first for anti-slop direction.
2. Then apply the project `nagarik-watch-product` skill for public vs staff, auth, and monetization rules.
3. Use impeccable / DESIGN.md tokens already in the repo (Civic Crimson, Devanagari-first).
4. Prefer dense editorial news-portal patterns over SaaS landing templates.
5. Do not invent third-party tracker copy; cookie and privacy pages must stay honest.

Never mention competitor news portals by name in UI copy or code comments.
